          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the Cassandra Server to generate audit records when unsuccessful attempts to modify privileges/permissions occur.

At the command prompt, execute the following command:

# grep '&lt;root' /usr/lib/vmware-vcops/user/conf/cassandra/logback.xml</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
